T:call-context-manager-capture-1a44e5d09bc0 = Context Manager: Capture the reasoning and conclusions from this discussion. What connections were drawn? What hypotheses were formed or rejected? What decisions were made about what to investigate next? Preserve the logic chain. If any leads or open questions were identified but not yet pursued, mark them with [LEAD]. Aim for about # tokens.
T:call-context-manager-system-7390a400c953 = Context Manager: System: You will soon form a new memory, get ready. The messages that follow are the slice of recent experience you are about to compress. After them, write the memory in your own voice.
